{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Revanchist</strong> is a first person survival horror game that takes inspiration from many of the genre's beloved classics. Follow a cryptic numbers station in search of answers and fight for survival as you uncover secrets buried for millennia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640820/extras/PunishingCombat.png?t=1747955550\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sometimes fighting isn't the only way forward. Conserve limited resources by carefully slipping past enemies or take matters into your own hands and carve your way through with a variety of unique and satisfying weaponry. Every encounter presents a choice, weigh your options and face your fears as you enter the world of survival horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640820/extras/Combat.gif?t=1747955550\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640820/extras/ItemManagement.png?t=1747955550\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The only thing more limited than supplies is your ability to carry them. Plan ahead and choose your loadout wisely if you want to survive. Balance firepower with abundance, offence with recovery. If you aren't careful you may find yourself backed into a corner, helpless to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640820/extras/ResourceManagement.gif?t=1747955550\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640820/extras/Exploration.png?t=1747955550\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're looking for answers or simply trying to survive, finding the way forward is up to you, there is nobody here to guide you. Scavenge for resources, solve puzzles, and explore a variety of detailed environments. Pay attention to your surroundings as you begin to piece together the the horrific story, discover horrors beyond comprehension, and grow to understand that sometimes things are best left undisturbed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640820/extras/Exploration.gif?t=1747955550\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640820/extras/ThinkFast.png?t=1747955550\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every action is a new decision, consider the consequences and prepare to live with them. Think in the moment, decide your loadout and pick your approach to combat. Understanding the risk and reward of every choice is essential for your survival. Do you dig deeper and push on to uncover the mysteries beneath you, or are you just trying to escape and survive to see tomorrow? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640820/extras/M_isc.gif?t=1747955550\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3640820?t=1747955550","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3640820?t=1747955550","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640820/824969f00202cfd05bc79bf8b3bd0cc65933dea1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747955550","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640820/824969f00202cfd05bc79bf8b3bd0cc65933dea1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747955550","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Frequent violence and gore. References to smoking and alcohol consumption. Mature language. Frightening and disturbing themes."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Revanchist</strong> is a first person survival horror game that takes inspiration from many of the genre's beloved classics. Follow a cryptic numbers station in search of answers and fight for survival as you uncover secrets buried for millennia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640820/extras/PunishingCombat.png?t=1747955550\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sometimes fighting isn't the only way forward. Conserve limited resources by carefully slipping past enemies or take matters into your own hands and carve your way through with a variety of unique and satisfying weaponry. Every encounter presents a choice, weigh your options and face your fears as you enter the world of survival horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640820/extras/Combat.gif?t=1747955550\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640820/extras/ItemManagement.png?t=1747955550\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The only thing more limited than supplies is your ability to carry them. Plan ahead and choose your loadout wisely if you want to survive. Balance firepower with abundance, offence with recovery. If you aren't careful you may find you